  "job_B3.2.19_20251003_114618": {
    "chunk_text": "& ferdon in \u00fea dune \u00fee is nemned Montem Olifete. \u00dea ongan h\u00e6lend spr\u00ebcan to his geongerum & he swa cw\u00e6\u00f0, So\u00f0 is \u00fe\u00e6t eow secge, ealle ge me do\u00f0 \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 Sanctus Petrus, \u00feeah hie \u00fee ealle geswicen, ic ana \u00fee n\u00e6fre ne swice. \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 him h\u00e6lend to, So\u00f0 is \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00f0e secge, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu me ons\u00e6cest on \u00feisse nihte \u00feriwa \u00e6r \u00feon \u00fee se \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 him eft Petrus to, Hw\u00e6t, me gedafena\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t ic swelte mid \u00fee \u00feonne ic \u00fee ons\u00e6ce. Eac swa ilce ealle his geongeran \u00fe\u00e6t cw\u00e6don. \u00dea cwom h\u00e6lend on \u00feone tun \u00fee is gietsamani genemned, \u00fea ongan he spr\u00ebcan to his geongerum, & he Genam him \u00fea Petrus mid & Sebe\u00f0\u00e6ges suna twegen, ongan \u00fea sona swi\u00fee unrotsian & an swi\u00f0e And \u00fea eode he lythwon from him, & feoll \u00f0a ofer his anwlitan, & geb\u00e6d hine \u00feissum wordum, & he And \u00fea cwom h\u00e6lend to his geongerum & mette hi sl\u00e6pende, & he cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fea to Sancte Petre, Forhwon Wacia\u00f0 ge nu, & gebidda\u00f0 eow \u00fei l\u00e6s ge gegangen on deofles anweald. And he cw\u00e6\u00f0, Min gast is swi\u00f0e fuus & min lichoma untrum. Feoll \u00f0a eft ofer his andwlitan & geb\u00e6d hine mid \u00feam ylcan wordum. \u00dea eode he \u00e6ft o\u00fere si\u00f0e, & geb\u00e6d hine, & cw\u00e6\u00f0, Gif \u00fee ie\u00f0e sy, gewite",
